  "title": "소지품",
  "nav_label": "소지품",
  "description": "스톤탑 소지품 별지. 가벼운 짐·보통 짐·무거운 짐에 따른 ◇ 칸 수, 장비와 작은 물품 목록, 물자 사용, 번영에 따른 장비의 질.",
  "sections": {
    "undefined": "미정",
    "gear": "장비",
    "possessions-items-loot": "소유물, 물품, 전리품",
    "other-things": "기타",
    "small-items": "작은 물품",
    "prosperity": "번영"
  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>네가 <strong><em>채비 갖추기</em></strong>를 할 때, 아래의 ◇를 몇 개 표시한다. 특정 물품에 하거나 미정에 표시한다.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>짐이 <strong>가벼운 짐</strong> (<em>빠르고 조용함</em>)이면 ◇를 3개까지 표시</li>\n<li>짐이 <strong>보통 짐</strong>이면 ◇를 4~6개 표시</li>\n<li>짐이 <strong>무거운 짐</strong> (<em>시끄럽고 느리고 덥고 쉬 지친다</em>)이면 ◇를 7~9개 표시</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">미정</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"표시 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"표시 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"표시 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"표시 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"표시 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"표시 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"표시 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"표시 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"표시 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"표시 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"표시 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"표시 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"표시 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"표시 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"표시 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"표시 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"표시 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"표시 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>필요한 것 챙겨두기</em></strong>를 할 때, 여기의 표시 하나를 아래의 특정 ◇로 옮긴다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">장비</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>물자</strong> (4+번영 사용 ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>추가 물자</strong> (4+번영 사용 ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>더 많은 물자</strong> (4+번영 사용 ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>물자는 회복하기, 야영하기, 또는 추가로 <em>작은</em> 물품을 지니는 데 쓴다.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>취사도구</strong> (불과 물이 필요하다. 물자가 더 오래 간다)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>침구</strong> (야영하기를 할 때 HP를 1d6 추가로 회복)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>담요</strong> (<em>따뜻함</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>갈아입을 옷</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>밧줄</strong>, 약 7.5m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>삽</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>썰매/들것/끌개</strong>, 말아서 휴대</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>설피</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>횃불</strong> (약 1시간 지속, <em>간격</em>, <em>범위</em>, <em>위험</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>기름등잔</strong> (○○○시간, <em>지근</em>, <em>범위</em>, <em>조악</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>여분의 기름</strong> (○○○○○시간, 등잔/등롱용, 무기로는 쓸모없다)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>장작</strong> (하룻밤을 버틸 만큼, <em>간격</em>, <em>범위</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>손도끼</strong>, 철제 (<em>근접</em>, <em>투척</em>, x 관통)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>망치</strong>, 철제 및/또는 목제 (<em>근접</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>곡괭이</strong>, 철제 (<em>지근</em>, x 관통, <em>참혹</em>, <em>다루기 힘듦</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>큰 망치</strong>, 철제 (<em>지근</em>, <em>밀쳐냄</em>, <em>다루기 힘듦</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>지팡이</strong> (<em>지근</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>창</strong>, 철제 (<em>지근</em>, <em>투척</em>, x 관통)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>장창</strong>, 철제 (<em>간격</em>, x 관통)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>활과 철촉 화살</strong> (<em>근거리</em>, x 관통, ○ 화살 부족, ○ 화살 소진)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>여분의 화살</strong> (x 관통, ○ 넉넉함, ○ 화살 부족, ○ 화살 소진)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>투창</strong>, 몇 자루, 철제 (<em>투척</em>, x 관통, +1 피해, ○ 소진)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>방패</strong> (+1 방어구, 지키기 7+에 방비 +1)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>두꺼운 가죽</strong> (방어구 1, <em>따뜻함</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>망토</strong> (<em>따뜻함</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">소유물, 물품, 전리품</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"칸\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"물품\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">기타</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(동물, 도구 일습, 맡겨둔 물품 등)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"기타\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">작은 물품</h3>\n<p>주머니, 쌈지, 장화에 들어간다. 네가 <strong><em>채비 갖추기</em></strong>를 할 때, 아래의 ☐를 4+번영만큼 표시한다.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">미정</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"표시 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"표시 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"표시 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"표시 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"표시 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"표시 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"표시 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"표시 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"표시 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"표시 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"표시 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"표시 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>필요한 것 챙겨두기</em></strong>를 할 때, 여기의 표시 하나를 아래 물품으로 옮기거나, 물자를 소모해 ☐를 하나 더 표시한다.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>칼